WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.040
- So, we came across this video

00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:03.690
of Cynthia singing on the street.

00:00:03.690 --> 00:00:05.167
So, let's see it and hear it.

00:00:05.167 --> 00:00:06.125
(Cynthia laughing)

00:00:06.125 --> 00:00:11.125
♪ I'll march my band out ♪

00:00:11.594 --> 00:00:16.363
♪ I'll beat my drum ♪

00:00:16.363 --> 00:00:19.819
♪ And if I'm fanned out ♪

00:00:19.819 --> 00:00:21.878
(audience cheering)
- That was so good.

00:00:21.878 --> 00:00:23.054
"Funny Girl", obviously.

00:00:23.054 --> 00:00:23.887
- Yeah.

00:00:23.887 --> 00:00:24.720
- I love "Funny Girl".

00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:26.848
So, that's eight years.

00:00:26.848 --> 00:00:28.050
Yeah, I love that whole musical.

00:00:28.050 --> 00:00:28.883
But what happened there?

00:00:28.883 --> 00:00:29.910
How did you just start singing that?

00:00:29.910 --> 00:00:30.743
I love you.

00:00:30.743 --> 00:00:32.430
- Well, um, he (laughs).

00:00:32.430 --> 00:00:33.710
- You're just like, "You know
what I think I feel like?"

00:00:33.710 --> 00:00:34.543
- We're in the middle of the street.

00:00:34.543 --> 00:00:36.180
I bumped into him in
the middle of the street

00:00:36.180 --> 00:00:39.300
and he asked me to sing something.

00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:42.060
I think he must have heard
me sing it one time before.

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:43.890
And he was like, "Can you
just do a little bit of it?

00:00:43.890 --> 00:00:44.723
Can you just?

00:00:44.723 --> 00:00:45.990
So, I was like, "Okay, sure."

00:00:45.990 --> 00:00:48.270
I don't mind any opportunity
where I can make some music.

00:00:48.270 --> 00:00:49.103
That's what I'm gonna do.

00:00:49.103 --> 00:00:49.936
- Oh, I don't, yeah.

00:00:49.936 --> 00:00:50.769
People always,

00:00:50.769 --> 00:00:52.237
it's like people coming
up to me and being like,

00:00:52.237 --> 00:00:53.070
"Oh, I don't know

00:00:53.070 --> 00:00:53.910
if you want me to talk
about "American Idol".

00:00:53.910 --> 00:00:54.743
I'm like, "Hell, yeah, dude.

00:00:54.743 --> 00:00:56.280
That's like, why I'm here."

00:00:56.280 --> 00:00:57.113
Yeah.

00:00:57.113 --> 00:00:58.770
- It's also like, there's just, you know-

00:00:58.770 --> 00:01:01.387
- You're gonna care when
they don't want you to sing.

00:01:01.387 --> 00:01:02.220
- That's the thing.

00:01:02.220 --> 00:01:04.950
It's like, I think the
wonderful thing about that.

00:01:04.950 --> 00:01:06.750
I knew it would bring him such joy.

00:01:06.750 --> 00:01:08.577
And he's such a joyous
energy and I wanted-

00:01:08.577 --> 00:01:09.990
- And you made his day.

00:01:09.990 --> 00:01:12.540
- It was so awesome and
I was having a great time

00:01:12.540 --> 00:01:14.310
and people across the street could see it.

00:01:14.310 --> 00:01:15.143
Like, it was just fun.

00:01:15.143 --> 00:01:16.617
- And you're reminded, right, of like-

00:01:16.617 --> 00:01:17.516
- Why you do it

00:01:17.516 --> 00:01:18.349
in the first place.
- Why you do it.

00:01:18.349 --> 00:01:19.710
How you fell in love with it.

00:01:19.710 --> 00:01:21.210
- Those are important moments.

